  "title": "IREN to Release FY26 Results on August 27, 2026",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, Aug. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- IREN Limited (NASDAQ: IREN) (\"IREN\") today announced that it will release its financial results for the fiscal year ended June 30, 2026, on Thursday, August 27, 2026 and host a conference call beginning at 5:00 p.m. Eastern Time.",
